<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device">
  <diagram name="Pipeline flow (merge/as)" id="pipeline-flow">
    <mxGraphModel dx="900" dy="1300" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="920" pageHeight="1260" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

        <mxCell id="title" value="Cancer response predictor - pipeline modules &amp; data flow (branch merge/as).   Each box: NAME (file) . key options . IN / OUT.   Target y in {0,1}: 1 = responds, 0 = does not.   Rule: OUT of each module = IN of the next." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="16" width="872" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gui" value="GUI  -  app.py + ui/   Password gate AND .tml4model key gate run first, both fail closed.   Two pages: 'Build &amp; predict' (tabs 1 Build / 2 Save-load / 3 Predict) and 'User manual' (/manual).   Help &amp; FAQs folds at the foot of both." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF6EE;strokeColor=#2E5E2E;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="54" width="872" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="m1" value="1  LOADER   (m1_loader.py + cohorts.py)&#10;sources: your CSV/TSV/TXT  .  bundled IMvigor210 cohort (298 patients,&#10;68 responders, +TMB for 234)  .  Tan layout (transposed)  .  synthetic demo&#10;caps: 50 MB per table, 50M cells (TML4_MAX_CELLS overrides)&#10;IN:   a table - rows = patients, cols = genes + a last label column&#10;OUT:  X [n x g],  y [n in {0,1}],  feature names" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2D5B7A;strokeColor=#1C3E56;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="100" width="420" height="112" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m1b" value="1b  IMAGING LOADER   (m1b_imaging_loader.py + imaging/)&#10;a SIBLING of module 1, not a later stage - same output contract&#10;zip or folder  &lt;class&gt;/&lt;patient&gt;/&lt;images&gt;, up to 500 MB&#10;reads png / tif / jpg / bmp / webp   (multi-page TIFF = a 3-D volume)&#10;measures ~102 radiomic features: intensity, texture, gradient, shape, radial&#10;ONE ROW PER PATIENT always (a patient's images are aggregated) - not an&#10;option, it is what stops the same patient landing in train and test&#10;OUT:  X [n x ~102],  y [n],  feature names" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1F5F70;strokeColor=#154453;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="476" y="100" width="420" height="112" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="m2" value="2  PREPROCESS   (m2_preprocess.py)   5 options&#10;identity / z-score / robust (median-IQR) / variance filter + z-score / log2 + z-score&#10;IN:   X [n x g]                              (from module 1 or 1b)&#10;OUT:  X' [n x g'] - same patients, columns rescaled / filtered" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E6E5E;strokeColor=#1E4A3F;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="246" width="380" height="86" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m3" value="3  FEATURE MAP   (m3_feature_map.py)   5 options&#10;identity / PCA(50) / class-conditional PCA / rank (TSP-style) / select best 500&#10;IN:   X' [n x g']                            (from module 2)&#10;OUT:  Z [n x k] - model-ready feature matrix" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E6E5E;strokeColor=#1E4A3F;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="356" width="380" height="86" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m4" value="4  CLASSIFIER   (m4_ml.py + estimators.py)   11 options&#10;RF . GB . Hist GB . LogReg . SVM linear . SVM RBF . decision tree . naive Bayes&#10;k-NN . K-TSP (top-scoring pairs) . nearest shrunken centroid&#10;the SVMs decide the class by their OWN rule; calibration only reports P&#10;IN:   Z [n x k] + y [n]                      (from module 3)&#10;OUT:  fitted classifier -&gt; y_hat + P(respond) per patient" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#3A4A86;strokeColor=#26315A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="466" width="380" height="104" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="asm" value="ASSEMBLER   (assemble.py)&#10;&#10;build_machine(2 -&gt; 3 -&gt; 4)&#10;= ONE sklearn Pipeline.&#10;&#10;Learned scaling + feature-map&#10;basis travel WITH the classifier,&#10;so predict re-applies the exact&#10;same steps.  Raw X in -&gt; y_hat / P out.&#10;&#10;For imaging, the MEASUREMENT&#10;settings travel too - a scan&#10;scored later is measured the&#10;way the training cohort was.&#10;&#10;+ compatibility_warnings():&#10;flags combos that can't fit." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF1F6;strokeColor=#2D5B7A;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="246" width="284" height="324" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="auto" value="AUTO (pick best)&#10;&#10;Set any of stages 2-4 to&#10;'Auto'; Build evaluates&#10;those options in parallel&#10;(slowest-first), skips&#10;combos that can't fit,&#10;never picks an unreliable&#10;one, keeps the best by&#10;BALANCED score.&#10;&#10;Optional TIME BUDGET drops&#10;setups predicted to overrun&#10;before they run (default:&#10;no limit = full search).&#10;&#10;COMPARE grid (2 x 3 x 4)&#10;-&gt; table ranked your way&#10;(balanced / accuracy /&#10;sensitivity / specificity /&#10;AUC) + CSV and PDF." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAEEDA;strokeColor=#BA7517;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="712" y="246" width="184" height="324" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="m5" value="5  EVALUATE   (m5_evaluate.py)&#10;k-fold CV (auto or manual folds); tiny classes -&gt; no-fold resubstitution&#10;IN:   assembled machine + X, y               (from modules 2-4)&#10;OUT:  metrics = accuracy, sensitivity, specificity, balanced, AUC, confusion&#10;UNRELIABLE if ANY of four: predicts one class  /  finds under 10% of a group&#10;/  does not beat chance on BALANCED accuracy  /  the solver never converged" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E5E2E;strokeColor=#204520;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="604" width="380" height="104" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m6" value="6  REPORT   (m6_report.py)&#10;verdict-first metrics, confusion matrix, run config; built in memory&#10;IN:   metrics + run config                   (from module 5)&#10;OUT:  on-screen report + downloadable PDF" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4B2E6B;strokeColor=#352050;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="742" width="380" height="86" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="trained" value="TRAINED MACHINE   (the assembled Pipeline, fit on ALL data)&#10;kept in the session;  saved / loaded as a locked .tml4model file" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#7A3B1F;strokeColor=#5A2A16;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="862" width="380" height="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="predict" value="PREDICT   (ui/predict.py)&#10;IN:   trained machine + new patients - pasted, a table, or scans (measured&#10;      with the settings stored in the model)&#10;checks the feature count; tolerates ONE trailing 0/1 marker column&#10;OUT:  yes/no + P(respond) per patient" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B6770;strokeColor=#3F474E;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="948" width="380" height="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m7" value="7  EXPLAIN   (m7_explain.py)&#10;occlude one feature at a time, watch predict_proba shift&#10;IN:   trained machine + patient x + training-set means (occlusion ref)&#10;OUT:  top features behind that prediction (gene-level even under PCA)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F6E56;strokeColor=#085041;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="1074" width="380" height="86" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="reports" value="Prediction &amp; comparison PDFs are produced by m6_report.py too:&#10;per-patient verdicts + top features, and setup-comparison tables." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F0FA;strokeColor=#4B2E6B;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="320" y="1190" width="380" height="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="saveload" value="SAVE / LOAD   (ui/model.py)&#10;&#10;Download the trained&#10;machine as a LOCKED&#10;.tml4model file:&#10;authenticated-encrypted&#10;+ app-locked - opens&#10;only here, can't be&#10;edited or reused&#10;(see README Security).&#10;&#10;Needs TML4_MODEL_KEY;&#10;no key, no start." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F6FB;strokeColor=#5B6770;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="712" y="852" width="184" height="188" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="e0" value="X, y" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="m1" target="m2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e0b" value="X, y  (same contract)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#1F5F70;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="m1b" target="m2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2" value="X'" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="m2" target="m3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e3" value="Z" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="m3" target="m4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e4" value="cross-validate" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="m4" target="m5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e5" value="metrics" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="m5" target="m6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e6" value="fit on ALL data" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#7A3B1F;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;dashed=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="asm" target="trained"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;" parent="1" edge="1" source="trained" target="predict"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" value="prediction" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="predict" target="m7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;" parent="1" edge="1" source="m7" target="reports"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e10" value=".tml4model" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=open;startArrow=open;strokeColor=#5B6770;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontSize=10;" parent="1" edge="1" source="trained" target="saveload"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
